/- Domain-style sampling:
- primary domain: Picard groups of commutative rings under factorization hypotheses, specialized
  here to a localization of a regular local ring;
- sampled owner declarations:
  `CommRing.Pic.instSubsingletonOfIsLocalRing`,
  `nagataCriterionForFactoriality`,
